OL,3,ATen people linked to Kenya's first-ever
OL,4,AEbola case quarantined as screening
OL,5,Aconcerns grow
OL,6,
OL,7,FTen people who came into contact with a
OL,8,Fman who died of Ebola in Kenya have
OL,9,Fbeen quarantined, health officials in
OL,10,Fthe East African nation say.
OL,12,FThey are also trying to trace 57 other
OL,13,Fcontacts of the Kenyan patient after he
OL,14,Ftravelled from the Democratic Republic
OL,15,Fof Congo, dying in hospital in Nairobi
OL,16,Fon Monday.
OL,18,FThis is the East African nation's
OL,19,Ffirst-ever Ebola case and there is now
OL,20,Fgrowing concern about the country's
OL,21,Fscreening measures.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
