OL,3,ATen people linked to Kenya's first-ever
OL,4,AEbola case quarantined as screening
OL,5,Aconcerns grow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Africa Centres for Disease Control
OL,8,Fand Prevention chief has told the BBC
OL,9,Fthat despite being sick for a month,
OL,10,Fthe patient passed through multiple
OL,11,Fcities in DR Congo, driving to Uganda
OL,12,Fand eventually flying to Kenya without
OL,13,Fhis sickness being detected.
